{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "\n\n... [预览已截断前 128 KB，点击右上角可导出完整原文件]": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n... [Preview truncated at 128 KB; tap the top-right button to export the full file]"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n... [预览已截断前 128 KB，点击右上角可导出完整原文件]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n⚠️ 本次修改了底层二进制缓存（国行底层限制 / Wi-Fi 显示 / 影像与健康硬件槽位），仅注销无法完全刷新系统守护进程，请务必【手动重启一次手机】使其生效！": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n⚠️ Low-level binary cache slots were modified (Unlock Mainland Hardware Flags / Wi-Fi label / camera & health hardware slots). A Respring alone cannot fully reload system daemons — please manually reboot your device once for changes to take effect!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n⚠️ 本次修改了底层二进制缓存（国行底层限制 / Wi-Fi 显示 / 影像与健康硬件槽位），仅注销无法完全刷新系统守护进程，请务必【手动重启一次手机】使其生效！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n提示：本次还原包含 Preferences 偏好设置，建议在后台多任务中彻底关闭目标应用或注销设备（Respring），以便系统 cfprefsd 重新加载配置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nTip: This restore includes Preferences files. Force-quit the target app from the App Switcher or Respring Device so cfprefsd reloads the configuration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n提示：本次还原包含 Preferences 偏好设置，建议在后台多任务中彻底关闭目标应用或注销设备（Respring），以便系统 cfprefsd 重新加载配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n若修改了地区限制或 Apple 智能，注销后建议手动重启一次设备以使 eligibilityd 完全刷新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nIf you modified Region Restrictions or Apple Intelligence, manually rebooting your device once after Respring is recommended so eligibilityd fully refreshes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n若修改了地区限制或 Apple 智能，注销后建议手动重启一次设备以使 eligibilityd 完全刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n附加恢复项：%@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nAdditional restored items: %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n附加恢复项：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# 1. 国行 Siri 语音主网关与普通话来电询问必须真实 IP 直连（严禁走代理）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 1. Mainland China (CH/A) Siri voice gateway & Mandarin Call Screening must connect via DIRECT with real IP (never proxy)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 1. 国行 Siri 语音主网关与普通话来电询问必须真实 IP 直连（严禁走代理）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# 2. Apple Intelligence 区域定位校验、PCC 隐私计算中继与匿名令牌签发（置顶防 GEOSITE,apple,DIRECT 抢行）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 2. Apple Intelligence region check, Private Cloud Compute (PCC) relay & anonymous token issuance (keep at top above GEOSITE,apple,DIRECT)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 2. Apple Intelligence 区域定位校验、PCC 隐私计算中继与匿名令牌签发（置顶防 GEOSITE,apple,DIRECT 抢行）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# 2. Apple Intelligence 区域定位校验、PCC 隐私计算中继与匿名令牌签发（请使用支持 UDP/QUIC 的低并发干净美区节点）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 2. Apple Intelligence region check, Private Cloud Compute (PCC) relay & anonymous token issuance (use a clean, low-concurrency US proxy node with UDP/QUIC enabled)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 2. Apple Intelligence 区域定位校验、PCC 隐私计算中继与匿名令牌签发（请使用支持 UDP/QUIC 的低并发干净美区节点）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# 3. Siri ChatGPT 扩展与视觉智能（提问 + Google 识图）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 3. Siri ChatGPT extension & Visual Intelligence (Ask + Google visual lookup)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 3. Siri ChatGPT 扩展与视觉智能（提问 + Google 识图）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n\n为防止触发系统启动校验失败或射频异常，安全护栏禁止在 CacheExtra 中手动注入此键。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nTo prevent boot validation failures or baseband/RF malfunctions, Safety Guardrail blocks manually injecting this key into CacheExtra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\n为防止触发系统启动校验失败或射频异常，安全护栏禁止在 CacheExtra 中手动注入此键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n\n你可以选择下方的「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」，让 iOS 在重启时直接从主板硬件熔丝重新生成 100%% 原厂参数。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nYou can select \"Rebuild Clean Factory Cache\" below to let iOS regenerate 100%% genuine factory parameters directly from logic board hardware fuses on reboot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\n你可以选择下方的「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」，让 iOS 在重启时直接从主板硬件熔丝重新生成 100%% 原厂参数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n\n当前系统状态已被保存为初始备份。若希望获取 100%% 纯净原厂基线，可在右上角菜单选择「清除并重建缓存」并重启，或在「高级设置」导入你之前保存的原厂备份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nCurrent system state has been saved as the initial backup. To obtain a 100%% clean factory baseline, choose \"Purge & Rebuild Cache\" from the top-right menu and reboot, or import a previously saved Factory Backup in \"Advanced Settings\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\n当前系统状态已被保存为初始备份。若希望获取 100%% 纯净原厂基线，可在右上角菜单选择「清除并重建缓存」并重启，或在「高级设置」导入你之前保存的原厂备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
