    "[测试特性] AssetTagInformation 是系统配置描述文件中的原生资产铭牌字段，可在锁屏界面底部或关于本机中展示防丢联系方式或设备编号，不修改任何系统二进制或监管标记。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] AssetTagInformation is a native asset tag field in system configuration profiles that displays lost-and-found contact info or an asset ID at the bottom of the Lock Screen or in About, without altering any system binaries or supervision flags."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[测试特性] AssetTagInformation 是系统配置描述文件中的原生资产铭牌字段，可在锁屏界面底部或关于本机中展示防丢联系方式或设备编号，不修改任何系统二进制或监管标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
