    "「一键恢复原机出厂参数」将校验并原位还原 MobileGestalt 原厂备份（含跨重装系统金库冗余与 SHA-256 核验），同时自动清除锁屏底部文字、资产铭牌、伪监管残留与拨号键盘缓存。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"One-Tap Factory Restore\" verifies and restores your MobileGestalt Factory Backup in place (with reinstall-persistent system vault redundancy and SHA-256 verification), while automatically clearing Lock Screen footnote text, asset tags, fake supervision remnants, and dialer keypad cache."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「一键恢复原机出厂参数」将校验并原位还原 MobileGestalt 原厂备份（含跨重装系统金库冗余与 SHA-256 核验），同时自动清除锁屏底部文字、资产铭牌、伪监管残留与拨号键盘缓存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【地区修改模式细化说明】\n\n1. 完整美版 LL + LL/A（默认）：\n同时将区域代码改为 LL、系统销售地区改为 LL/A，并自动填入对应的美版监管型号 (Axxxx)，跨区域受限特性（海外版 Apple 智能、快门静音、健康区域特性等）一致性最完整。\n\n2. 仅改区域代码 LL（保留 CH/A 后缀与双卡兼容）：\n仅将区域代码 (RegionCode) 改为 LL，完整保留原机的销售地区后缀（如 CH/A）与原厂监管型号。既可满足基础 Apple 智能准入、让「设置 -> 关于本机」型号末尾继续显示 CH/A，也能避免国行双实体卡槽 + eSIM 机型（如 18 Pro / Pro Max）因映射无卡槽美版型号引发基带卡槽冲突。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Region Unlock Modes]\n\n1. Full US (LL + LL/A, Default):\nSets RegionCode to LL, sales region to LL/A, and auto-fills the matching US (LL/A) regulatory model (Axxxx). Provides the most consistent unlock for region-gated features (overseas Apple Intelligence, camera shutter mute, regional Health features, etc.).\n\n2. LL Region Code Only (Keep CH/A Suffix & Dual-SIM Compatibility):\nChanges only RegionCode to LL while preserving your original sales suffix (e.g. CH/A) and factory regulatory model. Satisfies baseline Apple Intelligence eligibility, keeps CH/A displayed in \"Settings -> General -> About\", and avoids baseband SIM-slot conflicts on Mainland China (CH/A) dual-physical-SIM + eSIM models (such as iPhone 18 Pro / Pro Max) caused by mapping SIM-trayless US models."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【地区修改模式细化说明】\n\n1. 完整美版 LL + LL/A（默认）：\n同时将区域代码改为 LL、系统销售地区改为 LL/A，并自动填入对应的美版监管型号 (Axxxx)，跨区域受限特性（海外版 Apple 智能、快门静音、健康区域特性等）一致性最完整。\n\n2. 仅改区域代码 LL（保留 CH/A 后缀与双卡兼容）：\n仅将区域代码 (RegionCode) 改为 LL，完整保留原机的销售地区后缀（如 CH/A）与原厂监管型号。既可满足基础 Apple 智能准入、让「设置 -> 关于本机」型号末尾继续显示 CH/A，也能避免国行双实体卡槽 + eSIM 机型（如 18 Pro / Pro Max）因映射无卡槽美版型号引发基带卡槽冲突。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【普通话“询问来电原因”与海外 Apple 智能黄金共存方案（测试特性）】\n\nApple 对来电筛选施加了基于系统“地区 (Locale)”的语音过滤：若系统地区设为“美国”会丢失中文普通话来电询问；若保持“中国大陆”则会阻断 Apple 智能。\n\n唯一实测完美共存四步配置：\n1. MobileGestalt：在本页开启“解除地区限制 (LL / LL/A)”并填写对应美版监管型号；\n2. 系统设置 -> 通用 -> 语言与地区：“地区”改为【台湾】，首选语言第一项保持【简体中文】；\n3. 系统设置 -> Apple 智能与 Siri：Siri 语言设为【中文（普通话 - 中国大陆）】；\n4. 分流规则：guzzoni.apple.com 与 *.siri.apple.com 必须走【DIRECT 直连 + 真实 IP (always-real-ip)】防 Siri 报错，仅将 apple-relay.apple.com、gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com 与 OpenAI 走美区节点（可在“跨容器应用共享组中心”一键导出 Surge 模块）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Mandarin Call Screening + Overseas Apple Intelligence Coexistence Guide (Beta)]\n\nApple filters Call Screening voices by system Region (Locale): setting Region to \"United States\" removes Mandarin Call Screening, while keeping \"China mainland\" blocks Apple Intelligence.\n\nVerified 4-Step Coexistence Setup:\n1. MobileGestalt: Enable \"Unlock Region Restrictions (LL / LL/A)\" on this page and set the matching US (LL/A) regulatory model;\n2. Settings -> General -> Language & Region: Set Region to [Taiwan], and keep [Simplified Chinese] as your primary Preferred Language;\n3. Settings -> Apple Intelligence & Siri: Set Siri Language to [Chinese (Mandarin - China mainland)];\n4. Proxy Routing: Route guzzoni.apple.com and *.siri.apple.com via [DIRECT + Real IP (always-real-ip)] to prevent Siri errors, and route only apple-relay.apple.com, gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com, and OpenAI through a US proxy node (exportable in one tap from the Cross-Container App Group Hub)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【普通话“询问来电原因”与海外 Apple 智能黄金共存方案（测试特性）】\n\nApple 对来电筛选施加了基于系统“地区 (Locale)”的语音过滤：若系统地区设为“美国”会丢失中文普通话来电询问；若保持“中国大陆”则会阻断 Apple 智能。\n\n唯一实测完美共存四步配置：\n1. MobileGestalt：在本页开启“解除地区限制 (LL / LL/A)”并填写对应美版监管型号；\n2. 系统设置 -> 通用 -> 语言与地区：“地区”改为【台湾】，首选语言第一项保持【简体中文】；\n3. 系统设置 -> Apple 智能与 Siri：Siri 语言设为【中文（普通话 - 中国大陆）】；\n4. 分流规则：guzzoni.apple.com 与 *.siri.apple.com 必须走【DIRECT 直连 + 真实 IP (always-real-ip)】防 Siri 报错，仅将 apple-relay.apple.com、gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com 与 OpenAI 走美区节点（可在“跨容器应用共享组中心”一键导出 Surge 模块）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】传统 RegionalBehaviorShutterClick 为只读动态探针（slot = -1），直接写 CacheExtra 无效。本开关组合修改 3 个真实 CacheData 布尔槽位：\n• DeviceSupportsRegionalCameraShutterRelaxation = true\n• KeyboardMutePreservesRegionalShutterClickBehavior = false\n• ...ForLegacyDevices = false\n可在无需更改整机销售地区的前提下，尝试解除日版 (J/A) 与韩版 (KH/A) 机型的强制相机快门音（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Legacy RegionalBehaviorShutterClick is a read-only dynamic probe (slot = -1), so writing it to CacheExtra has no effect. This toggle patches 3 real CacheData boolean slots:\n• DeviceSupportsRegionalCameraShutterRelaxation = true\n• KeyboardMutePreservesRegionalShutterClickBehavior = false\n• ...ForLegacyDevices = false\nLifts mandatory camera shutter sounds on Japanese (J/A) and Korean (KH/A) devices without changing the device sales region (reboot manually after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】传统 RegionalBehaviorShutterClick 为只读动态探针（slot = -1），直接写 CacheExtra 无效。本开关组合修改 3 个真实 CacheData 布尔槽位：\n• DeviceSupportsRegionalCameraShutterRelaxation = true\n• KeyboardMutePreservesRegionalShutterClickBehavior = false\n• ...ForLegacyDevices = false\n可在无需更改整机销售地区的前提下，尝试解除日版 (J/A) 与韩版 (KH/A) 机型的强制相机快门音（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】同步开启 CameraButtonCapability、TouchSensitiveCameraControl、HardwareDetents 与 CameraHaptics 四个交互槽位，解锁完整的“设置 -> 相机 -> 相机控制”电容轻按/滑动变焦配置面板（无物理按键机型仅展示设置面板，重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables four interaction slots together — CameraButtonCapability, TouchSensitiveCameraControl, HardwareDetents, and CameraHaptics — unlocking the full capacitive light-press/slide-zoom panel in \"Settings -> Camera -> Camera Control\" (devices without the physical button show the settings UI only; reboot required)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】同步开启 CameraButtonCapability、TouchSensitiveCameraControl、HardwareDetents 与 CameraHaptics 四个交互槽位，解锁完整的“设置 -> 相机 -> 相机控制”电容轻按/滑动变焦配置面板（无物理按键机型仅展示设置面板，重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】同步开启 HighLuminanceAlwaysOnDisplay 与 AlwaysOnDisplayFlipbook 槽位，解锁户外高亮全天候显示策略与低功耗翻页帧缓冲渲染（注：非 LTPO 屏幕开启 AOD 会增加待机耗电，重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables both HighLuminanceAlwaysOnDisplay and AlwaysOnDisplayFlipbook slots to unlock outdoor high-luminance Always-On Display policies and low-power flipbook frame-buffer rendering (Note: enabling AOD on non-LTPO displays increases idle battery drain; reboot required)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】同步开启 HighLuminanceAlwaysOnDisplay 与 AlwaysOnDisplayFlipbook 槽位，解锁户外高亮全天候显示策略与低功耗翻页帧缓冲渲染（注：非 LTPO 屏幕开启 AOD 会增加待机耗电，重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】同步开启 PhotosLocalLight、ToneMapping 与 HDRDeferredProcessing 三个影像后期管线布尔槽位，增强相册局部光影重绘、新一代色调映射与深度 HDR 延迟渲染能力（重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables three photo post-processing pipeline boolean slots — PhotosLocalLight, ToneMapping, and HDRDeferredProcessing — enhancing Photos local light relighting, next-gen tone mapping, and deep HDR deferred processing (reboot required)."
