    "【测试特性】同步开启 hearingaid-audio-equalization、hearingaid-low-energy-audio 与 hearingaid-power-reduction 三个连续布尔槽位，配合 AirPods Pro 2 / 3 尝试解锁听力健康均衡与临床助听器辅助能力（部分地区仍受 eligibilityd 医疗围栏限制，重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables three contiguous boolean slots — hearingaid-audio-equalization, hearingaid-low-energy-audio, and hearingaid-power-reduction — to unlock Hearing Health EQ and clinical Hearing Aid features with AirPods Pro 2 / 3 (some regions remain gated by eligibilityd medical geofencing; reboot required)."
