        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】同步开启 hearingaid-audio-equalization、hearingaid-low-energy-audio 与 hearingaid-power-reduction 三个连续布尔槽位，配合 AirPods Pro 2 / 3 尝试解锁听力健康均衡与临床助听器辅助能力（部分地区仍受 eligibilityd 医疗围栏限制，重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】将 DeviceSupportsUSLegallyCompliantBloodOxygen (E4vGMChwcVRKD8hMVxnRvg) 槽位设为 false，解除美版 (LL/A) 设备因专利禁令触发的软件层血氧测量屏蔽（国行机型原生已为 false 无需开启，重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Sets the DeviceSupportsUSLegallyCompliantBloodOxygen (E4vGMChwcVRKD8hMVxnRvg) slot to false, lifting the software-level Blood Oxygen block imposed on US (LL/A) devices due to patent restrictions (already false natively on Mainland China CH/A models; reboot required)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】将 DeviceSupportsUSLegallyCompliantBloodOxygen (E4vGMChwcVRKD8hMVxnRvg) 槽位设为 false，解除美版 (LL/A) 设备因专利禁令触发的软件层血氧测量屏蔽（国行机型原生已为 false 无需开启，重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】开启 DeviceShowsBatteryModelInformationLegacyHW 与 DynamicEndOfChargeLegacyHW 槽位，在旧款 iPhone / iPad 的“设置 -> 电池 / 关于本机”中尝试展示电池生产日期、首次使用时间与精确充电循环次数（重启生效；亦可使用本工具“物理电池与温控遥测”模块直读底层数据）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables DeviceShowsBatteryModelInformationLegacyHW and DynamicEndOfChargeLegacyHW slots to display battery manufacture date, first use date, and exact cycle count under \"Settings -> Battery / About\" on older iPhones and iPads (reboot required; you can also read raw hardware metrics directly via the Physical Battery & Thermal Telemetry module)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】开启 DeviceShowsBatteryModelInformationLegacyHW 与 DynamicEndOfChargeLegacyHW 槽位，在旧款 iPhone / iPad 的“设置 -> 电池 / 关于本机”中尝试展示电池生产日期、首次使用时间与精确充电循环次数（重启生效；亦可使用本工具“物理电池与温控遥测”模块直读底层数据）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】开启 DeviceSupportsBreathingDisturbancesMeasurements (e0HV2blYUDBk/MsMEQACNA) 槽位，解锁“健康 -> 呼吸 -> 呼吸紊乱”睡眠呼吸暂停风险趋势评估页面（需配合 Apple Watch 睡眠监测数据，重启生效）。": {
