            "value": "[Beta] Enables the DeviceSupportsBreathingDisturbancesMeasurements (e0HV2blYUDBk/MsMEQACNA) slot to unlock the \"Health -> Respiratory -> Breathing Disturbances\" sleep apnea trend view (requires Apple Watch sleep tracking data; reboot required)."
          }
