        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】开启 TouchDelivery120Hz (2OK50OGmkXM1ospsh766WQ) 槽位，向系统启用 120Hz 触控采样事件投递管线（注：60Hz 物理屏幕面板无法突破 60fps 画面刷新率，仅作用于触控采样投递层，重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables the TouchDelivery120Hz (2OK50OGmkXM1ospsh766WQ) slot to activate the 120Hz touch-sampling event delivery pipeline (Note: 60Hz physical display panels remain capped at a 60fps display refresh rate; affects touch event delivery only; reboot required)."
          }
