            "value": "【测试特性】开启 TouchDelivery120Hz (2OK50OGmkXM1ospsh766WQ) 槽位，向系统启用 120Hz 触控采样事件投递管线（注：60Hz 物理屏幕面板无法突破 60fps 画面刷新率，仅作用于触控采样投递层，重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性】开启高低功耗双阵列麦克风并发拾音槽位 DeviceSupportsConcurrentHPLPMics (dI30ovtFUIeLioNQKDMbGQ)，为语音备忘录录音棚伴奏叠录与多轨人声分离提供底层硬件能力标记（需麦克风 DSP 支持，重启生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta] Enables the dual high/low-power microphone array slot DeviceSupportsConcurrentHPLPMics (dI30ovtFUIeLioNQKDMbGQ), providing the hardware capability flag for Voice Memos layered studio recording and vocal separation (requires microphone DSP support; reboot required)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性】开启高低功耗双阵列麦克风并发拾音槽位 DeviceSupportsConcurrentHPLPMics (dI30ovtFUIeLioNQKDMbGQ)，为语音备忘录录音棚伴奏叠录与多轨人声分离提供底层硬件能力标记（需麦克风 DSP 支持，重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【测试特性提示】本分组所有开关均通过运行时从本机 libMobileGestalt.dylib 实时解析真实 CacheData 布尔槽位（QType=11）并在写前校验 CacheUUID、字节总长与槽位有效位。因不同机型的底层 ISP、传感器或地区守护进程（eligibilityd）支持程度存在差异，部分功能在缺乏物理硬件时仅解锁系统 UI 入口。应用后请【手动重启手机】验证效果，随时可关闭或还原备份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Beta Notice] Every toggle in this section dynamically resolves real CacheData boolean slots (QType=11) at runtime from the on-device libMobileGestalt.dylib and validates CacheUUID, byte length, and slot validity bits prior to writing. Because underlying ISP, sensor, and eligibilityd support varies across models, some toggles only surface system UI entries when physical hardware is absent. Manually reboot your device after applying to verify — you can disable toggles or restore your Factory Backup anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【测试特性提示】本分组所有开关均通过运行时从本机 libMobileGestalt.dylib 实时解析真实 CacheData 布尔槽位（QType=11）并在写前校验 CacheUUID、字节总长与槽位有效位。因不同机型的底层 ISP、传感器或地区守护进程（eligibilityd）支持程度存在差异，部分功能在缺乏物理硬件时仅解锁系统 UI 入口。应用后请【手动重启手机】验证效果，随时可关闭或还原备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【防呆护栏警告】真机实测表明：DeviceSupportsSiriHub (waGD2UTpntjbDXD1r3oALQ) 属于带屏家居中枢硬件 (HomeAccessory / HomePad) 专属路由标记。\n\n⚠️ 在 iPhone / iPad 上开启会导致 assistantd 请求不存在的 SiriHub 模型资产，使 Apple 智能无限卡死在“正在添加 Siri 支持内容，更新完成前，Siri 将无法使用”！\n\n安全护栏已默认锁定禁止在 iPhone / iPad 上新开启此项；如果你在旧版本曾开启过此开关，可直接关闭此项（或使用顶部 Apple 智能体检卡片一键修复）并手动重启手机即可恢复正常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Safety Guardrail] On-device testing confirms that DeviceSupportsSiriHub (waGD2UTpntjbDXD1r3oALQ) is an exclusive routing flag for smart-display home hub hardware (HomeAccessory / HomePad).\n\n⚠️ Enabling it on iPhone or iPad causes assistantd to request nonexistent SiriHub model assets, leaving Apple Intelligence permanently stuck on \"Adding Support for Siri. Siri will not be available until the update is complete\"!\n\nSafety Guardrail blocks enabling this flag on iPhone / iPad by default. If you previously enabled it in an older version, simply turn it off (or use the one-tap fix on the Apple Intelligence readiness card at the top) and manually reboot to recover."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【防呆护栏警告】真机实测表明：DeviceSupportsSiriHub (waGD2UTpntjbDXD1r3oALQ) 属于带屏家居中枢硬件 (HomeAccessory / HomePad) 专属路由标记。\n\n⚠️ 在 iPhone / iPad 上开启会导致 assistantd 请求不存在的 SiriHub 模型资产，使 Apple 智能无限卡死在“正在添加 Siri 支持内容，更新完成前，Siri 将无法使用”！\n\n安全护栏已默认锁定禁止在 iPhone / iPad 上新开启此项；如果你在旧版本曾开启过此开关，可直接关闭此项（或使用顶部 Apple 智能体检卡片一键修复）并手动重启手机即可恢复正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【防呆护栏警告】真机（iPhone 18 Pro Max · iPhone19,7）底层探针核验确认：iOS 27 音频智能 (rb2tKZxlj0Gm2tBmUQSLqQ，槽位 #178) 在 iPhone / iPad 原厂设备树中默认均为 false（0x00），而个人实时翻译 (M1n2sAqf33NAOgZRGxQYBA，槽位 #266) 在支持的原生硬件（如 iPhone 18 Pro 系列）上原厂已自动开启为 true（0x01）。\n\n⚠️ 在 iPhone / iPad 上强行开启非原生的 Audio Intelligence 实验槽位会导致系统生成式模型管线校验断路——直接造成照片【“高质量”消除 (ServerDiffusionInpainting)】报错失效（提示“消除此照片时出错。请稍后再试。”）！\n\n常规通话录音、语音备忘录转写与系统翻译均由主 AI 开关完整支持，本机原生自带的 Personal Translator 也会被自动识别保留。安全护栏已默认锁定防误开；若此前在旧版本中曾开启，直接关闭此开关（或点击顶部体检卡片一键修复）并应用即可恢复原厂基线与高质量消除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Safety Guardrail] Hardware probe verification on physical devices (iPhone 18 Pro Max · iPhone19,7) confirms that iOS 27 Audio Intelligence (rb2tKZxlj0Gm2tBmUQSLqQ, Slot #178) defaults to false (0x00) in factory iPhone / iPad device trees, whereas Personal Translator (M1n2sAqf33NAOgZRGxQYBA, Slot #266) is natively enabled as true (0x01) on supported hardware (such as the iPhone 18 Pro lineup).\n\n⚠️ Forcing the non-native experimental Audio Intelligence slot on iPhone or iPad breaks generative model pipeline validation — causing high-quality Photos Clean Up (ServerDiffusionInpainting) to fail with \"There was an error cleaning up this photo. Please try again later.\"!\n\nStandard call recording, Voice Memos transcription, and system translation are already fully covered by the master AI toggle, and native Personal Translator support is automatically preserved. Safety Guardrail locks this slot off by default; if enabled in an earlier version, turn it off (or tap the one-tap fix on the top readiness card) and apply to restore your factory baseline and high-quality Clean Up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【防呆护栏警告】真机（iPhone 18 Pro Max · iPhone19,7）底层探针核验确认：iOS 27 音频智能 (rb2tKZxlj0Gm2tBmUQSLqQ，槽位 #178) 在 iPhone / iPad 原厂设备树中默认均为 false（0x00），而个人实时翻译 (M1n2sAqf33NAOgZRGxQYBA，槽位 #266) 在支持的原生硬件（如 iPhone 18 Pro 系列）上原厂已自动开启为 true（0x01）。\n\n⚠️ 在 iPhone / iPad 上强行开启非原生的 Audio Intelligence 实验槽位会导致系统生成式模型管线校验断路——直接造成照片【“高质量”消除 (ServerDiffusionInpainting)】报错失效（提示“消除此照片时出错。请稍后再试。”）！\n\n常规通话录音、语音备忘录转写与系统翻译均由主 AI 开关完整支持，本机原生自带的 Personal Translator 也会被自动识别保留。安全护栏已默认锁定防误开；若此前在旧版本中曾开启，直接关闭此开关（或点击顶部体检卡片一键修复）并应用即可恢复原厂基线与高质量消除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
