    "为不支持 Apple 智能的旧机型开启端侧生成式 AI 总开关 (DeviceSupportsGenerativeModelSystems)，并自动同步解锁以下 2 项在旧芯片上默认关闭的子能力标记：\n\n• 相册“消除”功能 (Photos Clean Up)\n• 备忘录“手写体合成” (Handwriting Synthesis)\n\n注：旧机型若需实际下载端侧 AI 模型，通常还需配合下方的“机型伪装”与上方的“解除地区限制”使用（修改后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enables the master on-device generative AI gate (DeviceSupportsGenerativeModelSystems) for older devices lacking native Apple Intelligence, and automatically unlocks 2 sub-capabilities disabled by default on older chips:\n\n• Photos Clean Up\n• Notes Handwriting Synthesis\n\nNote: To actually download on-device AI models on unsupported models, combine this with \"Model Spoofing\" below and \"Unlock Region Restrictions\" above (manually reboot after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为不支持 Apple 智能的旧机型开启端侧生成式 AI 总开关 (DeviceSupportsGenerativeModelSystems)，并自动同步解锁以下 2 项在旧芯片上默认关闭的子能力标记：\n\n• 相册“消除”功能 (Photos Clean Up)\n• 备忘录“手写体合成” (Handwriting Synthesis)\n\n注：旧机型若需实际下载端侧 AI 模型，通常还需配合下方的“机型伪装”与上方的“解除地区限制”使用（修改后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
