    "从 InternalDaemon 只读解析 com.apple.LaunchServices-*.csstore 二进制库（魔数 bdsl），可在数十毫秒内完成全机应用容器、扩展插件与 AppGroup 映射并显示应用名称；若读取失败会自动无缝回退至传统 pathleak 遍历。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parses com.apple.LaunchServices-*.csstore binary stores (magic bdsl) read-only from InternalDaemon to map all app containers, extensions, and App Groups with localized app names in tens of milliseconds; seamlessly falls back to legacy pathleak traversal if reading fails."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 InternalDaemon 只读解析 com.apple.LaunchServices-*.csstore 二进制库（魔数 bdsl），可在数十毫秒内完成全机应用容器、扩展插件与 AppGroup 映射并显示应用名称；若读取失败会自动无缝回退至传统 pathleak 遍历。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上实验模块与设置页中的「CSStore2 极速容器映射引擎」均为 v0.8.0 测试特性：所有系统数据库均采用 APFS clonefile() 零锁只读快照读取，不修改原始守护进程文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
