            "value": "The experimental modules above and the \"CSStore2 Fast Container Mapping Engine\" in Settings are v0.8.0 Beta features: all system databases are read via lock-free APFS clonefile() read-only snapshots without touching original daemon files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
