    },
    "以下能力全部通过本机 libMobileGestalt.dylib 实时解析二进制布尔槽位偏移并执行零白苹果写前校验。受各机型物理传感器与 eligibilityd 策略差异影响，实际表现可能因设备而异，修改后请重启设备测试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All capabilities below dynamically resolve binary boolean Slot Offsets from the local libMobileGestalt.dylib with bootloop-safe pre-write validation. Actual behavior varies by physical sensors and eligibilityd policies across models — reboot your device after applying to test."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下能力全部通过本机 libMobileGestalt.dylib 实时解析二进制布尔槽位偏移并执行零白苹果写前校验。受各机型物理传感器与 eligibilityd 策略差异影响，实际表现可能因设备而异，修改后请重启设备测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
