    "伪装设备型号可能会导致面容 ID (Face ID) 等硬件功能失效！你的设备硬件本身已原生支持 Apple 智能，无需修改此项（国行设备只需开启上方“解除地区限制”即可）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spoofing device model identifiers can break Face ID and other hardware features! Your hardware already natively supports Apple Intelligence, so changing this is unnecessary — Mainland China (CH/A) devices only need \"Unlock Region Restrictions\" above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伪装设备型号可能会导致面容 ID (Face ID) 等硬件功能失效！你的设备硬件本身已原生支持 Apple 智能，无需修改此项（国行设备只需开启上方“解除地区限制”即可）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你可能没有查看此目录的权限，请前往主页查看运行日志了解详情。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
