    "保持国行 Siri 与普通话询问来电原因 (guzzoni) 真实 IP 直连，同时将 Apple Intelligence 隐私云计算、定位准入与视觉智能置顶分流至 %@（请确保所选美区节点已开启 udp: true）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps Mainland China (CH/A) Siri and Mandarin Call Screening (guzzoni) on DIRECT real-IP connections while routing Apple Intelligence Private Cloud Compute, region eligibility, and Visual Intelligence at top priority through %@ (ensure udp: true is enabled on your US proxy node)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
