    "全程以纯只读快照方式解析语音备忘录与通话录音（保留自定义标题与无损 .m4a 音轨），并探测本机离线翻译、语音转写与端侧 AI 模型资产缓存体积。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parses Voice Memos and Call Recordings strictly via read-only snapshots (preserving custom titles and lossless .m4a tracks), and probes cache sizes for offline translation, speech transcription, and on-device AI model assets."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全程以纯只读快照方式解析语音备忘录与通话录音（保留自定义标题与无损 .m4a 音轨），并探测本机离线翻译、语音转写与端侧 AI 模型资产缓存体积。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
