    "即使卸载重装了游戏或应用导致容器 UUID 改变，点击“一键还原”也会按 Bundle ID 自动定位当前最新容器并原位写回存档。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Even if reinstalling an app or game changes its container UUID, tapping \"One-Tap Restore\" automatically locates the latest container by Bundle ID and writes your save data back in place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使卸载重装了游戏或应用导致容器 UUID 改变，点击“一键还原”也会按 Bundle ID 自动定位当前最新容器并原位写回存档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即将执行全模块一键恢复原机出厂参数：\n\n1. 恢复并校验本机 MobileGestalt 原厂备份（含 SHA-256 与物理刷盘验证）；\n2. 清除锁屏底部文字、设备资产铭牌及第三方伪监管残留（自动保护真实企业 MDM）；\n3. 清理自定义拨号键盘缓存并复位所有本地偏好状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About to execute a full-module One-Tap Factory Restore:\n\n1. Restore and verify this device's MobileGestalt Factory Backup (with SHA-256 and physical disk-flush verification);\n2. Clear Lock Screen footnote text, device asset tags, and third-party fake supervision remnants (automatically preserving legitimate enterprise MDM);\n3. Clean custom dialer keypad caches and reset all local preference states."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即将执行全模块一键恢复原机出厂参数：\n\n1. 恢复并校验本机 MobileGestalt 原厂备份（含 SHA-256 与物理刷盘验证）；\n2. 清除锁屏底部文字、设备资产铭牌及第三方伪监管残留（自动保护真实企业 MDM）；\n3. 清理自定义拨号键盘缓存并复位所有本地偏好状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即将执行本机原厂参数恢复：\n\n1. 严格核对原厂备份的 SHA-256 摘要、系统版本、CacheUUID 与真实硬件型号；\n2. 通过无零字节窗口原位刷盘 (pwrite + F_FULLFSYNC) 恢复 MobileGestalt 并读回验证；\n3. 同步复位本地自定义键值、自定义机型名与越界门禁开关，杜绝残留回写。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About to restore this device's factory parameters:\n\n1. Strictly verify the Factory Backup's SHA-256 digest, iOS version, CacheUUID, and true hardware model;\n2. Restore MobileGestalt via zero-byte-window-free in-place disk flush (pwrite + F_FULLFSYNC) with read-back verification;\n3. Reset local custom keys, spoofed model names, and guardrail overrides in sync to prevent stale write-backs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即将执行本机原厂参数恢复：\n\n1. 严格核对原厂备份的 SHA-256 摘要、系统版本、CacheUUID 与真实硬件型号；\n2. 通过无零字节窗口原位刷盘 (pwrite + F_FULLFSYNC) 恢复 MobileGestalt 并读回验证；\n3. 同步复位本地自定义键值、自定义机型名与越界门禁开关，杜绝残留回写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
