          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原始备份文件来自旧版系统 (%@)，而当前系统已更新至 %@（当前缓存处于原厂未修改状态）。\n\n建议立即将原始备份同步更新为 %@ 的原厂文件，以免后续误用旧版备份覆盖。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original backup is from an older iOS version (%@), while your device is now on %@ (current cache is unmodified stock).\n\nIt is recommended to update your Factory Backup to the stock %@ file immediately to avoid accidentally overwriting with an outdated backup later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始备份文件来自旧版系统 (%@)，而当前系统已更新至 %@（当前缓存处于原厂未修改状态）。\n\n建议立即将原始备份同步更新为 %@ 的原厂文件，以免后续误用旧版备份覆盖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原始备份的 CacheData 长度 (%lld 字节) 与当前系统 (%lld 字节) 不一致，已阻止直接写入！\n\n点击「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」并重启即可安全恢复 100%% 原厂状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backup's CacheData length (%lld bytes) does not match the current system (%lld bytes); direct write has been blocked!\n\nTap \"Rebuild Clean Stock Cache\" and reboot to safely restore 100%% factory state."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始备份的 CacheData 长度 (%lld 字节) 与当前系统 (%lld 字节) 不一致，已阻止直接写入！\n\n点击「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」并重启即可安全恢复 100%% 原厂状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原始备份的 CacheUUID (%@) 与当前系统 (%@) 不一致，安全护栏已阻止直接覆盖。\n\n点击「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」并重启即可安全恢复 100%% 原厂状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backup's CacheUUID (%@) does not match the current system (%@); the safety guardrail blocked direct overwriting.\n\nTap \"Rebuild Clean Stock Cache\" and reboot to safely restore 100%% factory state."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始备份的 CacheUUID (%@) 与当前系统 (%@) 不一致，安全护栏已阻止直接覆盖。\n\n点击「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」并重启即可安全恢复 100%% 原厂状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
