    "在 iPhone 上强制启用 iPadOS 界面需篡改未经验证的 CacheData 偏移，在锁屏密码或横竖屏切换时极易引发无限白苹果重启与触控冻结，防白苹果护栏已永久禁用该功能。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Forcing the iPadOS UI on an iPhone requires patching unverified CacheData offsets, which frequently triggers infinite bootloops and touch freezes during Lock Screen passcode entry or rotation. The anti-bootloop guardrail has permanently disabled this feature."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上强制启用 iPadOS 界面需篡改未经验证的 CacheData 偏移，在锁屏密码或横竖屏切换时极易引发无限白苹果重启与触控冻结，防白苹果护栏已永久禁用该功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在“文件”中查看目录": {
