          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在个人零售版 iOS 设备上强行写入 IsSupervised=true 极易触发 Setup.app 远程管理向导无限循环锁死（Setup Assistant Loop / 403 死锁）甚至无法进入桌面！防白苹果护栏已永久禁用开启监管模式；如曾通过旧版或其他工具误开启过，可在下方“伪监管残留死锁体检”中一键单独清理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Forcing IsSupervised=true on a retail personal iOS device frequently triggers an infinite Setup.app Remote Management lockout (Setup Assistant Loop / 403 deadlock) that prevents reaching the Home Screen! The anti-bootloop guardrail permanently blocks enabling Supervision; if previously enabled by an older build or third-party tool, use \"Fake Supervision Deadlock Check\" below to clean it up in one tap."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在个人零售版 iOS 设备上强行写入 IsSupervised=true 极易触发 Setup.app 远程管理向导无限循环锁死（Setup Assistant Loop / 403 死锁）甚至无法进入桌面！防白苹果护栏已永久禁用开启监管模式；如曾通过旧版或其他工具误开启过，可在下方“伪监管残留死锁体检”中一键单独清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在成功应用功能修改后自动触发设备注销 (Respring)。标记为 [测试特性] 的功能若遇系统兼容异常可随时在此关闭并回退。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically Respring the device after applying Tweaks. Features marked [Beta] can be turned off and reverted here anytime if compatibility issues arise."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
