    "如果你当前设置了字母数字混合锁屏密码，请切勿开启此项！开启后也切勿关闭“在台前调度中显示程序坞”，否则会导致设备软砖（白苹果循环）。启用 iPadOS 界面后可能出现界面错位、部分应用不兼容等问题。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do NOT enable this if you use an alphanumeric Lock Screen passcode! Once enabled, NEVER turn off \"Show Dock in Stage Manager\", or your device will soft-brick (bootloop). Enabling the iPadOS UI may also cause layout glitches and app incompatibility."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你当前设置了字母数字混合锁屏密码，请切勿开启此项！开启后也切勿关闭“在台前调度中显示程序坞”，否则会导致设备软砖（白苹果循环）。启用 iPadOS 界面后可能出现界面错位、部分应用不兼容等问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果应用自定义壁纸后无法正常显示，可尝试重置上方任意对应类型的壁纸扩展缓存。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If custom wallpapers fail to display properly after applying, try resetting the corresponding wallpaper extension cache above."
