    "对于不支持 Apple 智能的旧机型，仅开启开关无法下载端侧 AI 模型，还需伪装为支持的机型；但伪装机型可能导致面容 ID 失效。取消机型伪装后，请勿再次进入“设置 -> Apple 智能与 Siri”页面。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On older models unsupported by Apple Intelligence, enabling the toggle alone will not download on-device AI models—you must also spoof a supported model, which may break Face ID. After removing model spoofing, do NOT open \"Settings -> Apple Intelligence & Siri\" again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对于不支持 Apple 智能的旧机型，仅开启开关无法下载端侧 AI 模型，还需伪装为支持的机型；但伪装机型可能导致面容 ID 失效。取消机型伪装后，请勿再次进入“设置 -> Apple 智能与 Siri”页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
