      }
    },
    "开启后默认把销售地区改为完整美版 (LL + LL/A) 并映射对应美版监管型号 (Axxxx)；你也可在下方子选项切换为「仅改区域代码 LL（保留 CH/A 后缀与双卡兼容）」。请遵守当地法律法规并自行承担使用风险。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, sets the sales region to full US (LL + LL/A) and maps the matching US regulatory model (Axxxx) by default; you can also switch to \"Region Code LL Only (Keep CH/A Suffix & Dual-SIM Compatibility)\" in the sub-options below. Please comply with local laws and regulations and use at your own risk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后默认把销售地区改为完整美版 (LL + LL/A) 并映射对应美版监管型号 (Axxxx)；你也可在下方子选项切换为「仅改区域代码 LL（保留 CH/A 后缀与双卡兼容）」。请遵守当地法律法规并自行承担使用风险。"
          }
        }
      }
