    "当前侧载签名工具剥离了 App Group 容器权限，导致只能读取而无法写入 MobileGestalt。\n\n请更换保留 App Groups 能力的工具重新签名安装（免费个人自签推荐 SideStore / AltStore / Impactor / iLoader；证书重签请确保描述文件勾选了 App Groups 权限，切勿使用默认剥离权限的 Sideloadly 免费签）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your current sideloading tool stripped App Group container entitlements, leaving MobileGestalt read-only and unable to write.\n\nPlease re-sign and reinstall using a tool that preserves App Groups (SideStore / AltStore / Impactor / iLoader are recommended for free personal signing; for certificate signing, ensure the provisioning profile includes App Groups, and avoid Sideloadly free signing which strips them by default)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前侧载签名工具剥离了 App Group 容器权限，导致只能读取而无法写入 MobileGestalt。\n\n请更换保留 App Groups 能力的工具重新签名安装（免费个人自签推荐 SideStore / AltStore / Impactor / iLoader；证书重签请确保描述文件勾选了 App Groups 权限，切勿使用默认剥离权限的 Sideloadly 免费签）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
