    "提示：iPhone/iPad 强开此实验槽位会导致照片“高质量”消除报错，建议保持关闭（不影响常规通话录音与转写）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note: Force-enabling this experimental slot on iPhone/iPad causes High-Quality Clean Up in Photos to fail; keep it off (does not affect regular Call Recording & Transcription)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示：iPhone/iPad 强开此实验槽位会导致照片“高质量”消除报错，建议保持关闭（不影响常规通话录音与转写）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提示：系统“设置 -> 电池健康”显示的百分比经过平滑校准算法修饰，而 AppleRawMaxCapacity 反映 PMU 电量计芯片测得的真实物理满电容量。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note: The percentage shown in Settings -> Battery Health is smoothed by Apple's calibration algorithm, whereas AppleRawMaxCapacity reflects the true physical full-charge capacity measured by the PMU gas gauge chip."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示：系统“设置 -> 电池健康”显示的百分比经过平滑校准算法修饰，而 AppleRawMaxCapacity 反映 PMU 电量计芯片测得的真实物理满电容量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
