    "支持直接输入混淆 Base64 键名（如 aVL5GE3tx0LSCI/ErfrJGA）或系统支持的标准明文键名（如 ProductType、RegionCode、BuildVersion），实时对比进程内 MGCopyAnswer 返回值与磁盘缓存状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter an obfuscated Base64 key (e.g., aVL5GE3tx0LSCI/ErfrJGA) or a standard plaintext key supported by iOS (e.g., ProductType, RegionCode, BuildVersion) to compare live in-process MGCopyAnswer return values against on-disk cache state in real time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持直接输入混淆 Base64 键名（如 aVL5GE3tx0LSCI/ErfrJGA）或系统支持的标准明文键名（如 ProductType、RegionCode、BuildVersion），实时对比进程内 MGCopyAnswer 返回值与磁盘缓存状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
