            "value": "本机系统库动态缓存偏移解析、变更对比预览、写后校验与重签 App Group 探测等优秀设计参考"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本组能力由设备树 (IODeviceTree) 映射至二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位，必须通过动态槽位偏移直接写入 CacheData 才能绕过系统 _MGCacheSetValueForKey 有效性短路检查。本机已原生开启的硬件能力会自动锁定以防误关降级；应用后请手动重启手机生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These capabilities are mapped from IODeviceTree to binary CacheData boolean slots and must be written directly via dynamic slot offsets to bypass iOS _MGCacheSetValueForKey validity short-circuit checks. Capabilities already natively enabled on your device are locked to prevent accidental downgrade; reboot manually after applying."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本组能力由设备树 (IODeviceTree) 映射至二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位，必须通过动态槽位偏移直接写入 CacheData 才能绕过系统 _MGCacheSetValueForKey 有效性短路检查。本机已原生开启的硬件能力会自动锁定以防误关降级；应用后请手动重启手机生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
