    "核心原理：将 guzzoni.apple.com / siri.apple.com / smoot.apple.com 设为 DIRECT 并加入真实 IP 白名单（always-real-ip / fake-ip-filter），保障国行 Siri 与普通话来电筛选秒通；同时将 gspe1-ssl、apple-relay.*、OpenAI 与 Google 视觉智能置顶分流至美区策略组（注意：所选美区节点需支持 UDP/QUIC）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Core Mechanism: Routes guzzoni.apple.com / siri.apple.com / smoot.apple.com via DIRECT and adds them to real-IP allowlists (always-real-ip / fake-ip-filter) so Mainland China (CH/A) Siri and Mandarin Call Screening connect instantly, while routing gspe1-ssl, apple-relay.*, OpenAI, and Google Visual Intelligence with top priority to your US proxy group (Note: the selected US node must support UDP/QUIC)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核心原理：将 guzzoni.apple.com / siri.apple.com / smoot.apple.com 设为 DIRECT 并加入真实 IP 白名单（always-real-ip / fake-ip-filter），保障国行 Siri 与普通话来电筛选秒通；同时将 gspe1-ssl、apple-relay.*、OpenAI 与 Google 视觉智能置顶分流至美区策略组（注意：所选美区节点需支持 UDP/QUIC）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核心核验": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
