    "检测到原始备份来自旧版系统 (%@)，而当前系统已升级至 %@，二进制槽位布局已变化，直接覆盖存在风险。\n\n点击下方「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」即可安全删除旧缓存，并在重启后由 %@ 系统自动重算 100%% 原厂参数！": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detected that your factory backup was created on an older iOS build (%@) while your device is now on %@; the binary slot layout has changed and overwriting directly carries risk.\n\nTap \"Rebuild Clean Factory System Cache\" below to safely delete the stale cache and let iOS %@ recalculate 100%% factory parameters automatically upon reboot!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测到原始备份来自旧版系统 (%@)，而当前系统已升级至 %@，二进制槽位布局已变化，直接覆盖存在风险。\n\n点击下方「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」即可安全删除旧缓存，并在重启后由 %@ 系统自动重算 100%% 原厂参数！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
