    "此选项将启用部分遗留在正式版 iOS 中的 Apple 内部调试特性。注意：开启后可能会影响部分正常功能（如无法从 App Store 重新安装自带系统应用），且与 Apple 智能互斥。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enables certain internal Apple debug features left in retail iOS builds. Warning: May break normal functionality (such as reinstalling stock iOS apps from the App Store) and is mutually exclusive with Apple Intelligence."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
