          }
        }
      }
    },
    "注：原生支持 Apple 智能的机型默认隐藏旧机型专用的“Apple 智能总开关”与“机型伪装”（国行机型仅需开启“解除地区限制”与下方“green-tea 底层限制”即可激活）；“解锁 iOS 27 进阶 AI 能力”将根据当前机型与固件版本实时展示开关或原生状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note: Devices with native Apple Intelligence hide the legacy-only \"Apple Intelligence Master Toggle\" and \"Model Spoofing\" by default (Mainland China (CH/A) models only need \"Unlock Region Restrictions\" and the \"green-tea\" hardware flag below); \"Unlock iOS 27 Advanced AI\" dynamically shows toggles or native status based on your device and firmware."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注：原生支持 Apple 智能的机型默认隐藏旧机型专用的“Apple 智能总开关”与“机型伪装”（国行机型仅需开启“解除地区限制”与下方“green-tea 底层限制”即可激活）；“解锁 iOS 27 进阶 AI 能力”将根据当前机型与固件版本实时展示开关或原生状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
