          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap \"Backup Save Data\" to archive the app's Documents and Library/Preferences into a ZIP file, or tap \"Edit Documents\" or \"Edit Preferences Plist\" to modify game values or settings directly using the built-in lossless Plist/text editor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击“备份存档”会将该应用的 Documents 与 Library/Preferences 打包为 ZIP；点击“修改 Documents”或“修改配置 Plist”可直接调用内置无损 Plist/文本编辑器修改游戏数值或配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击“确认”后，将安全清除锁屏底部文字与设备资产铭牌，并恢复或清理残留的监管配置文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapping \"Confirm\" will safely clear the Lock Screen footnote and device asset tag, and restore or clean up residual supervision configuration files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击“确认”后，将安全清除锁屏底部文字与设备资产铭牌，并恢复或清理残留的监管配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击“确认写入”后将自动备份当前缓存、执行原位写入并进行完整读回校验；若校验异常将自动回滚原文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapping \"Confirm Write\" will automatically back up the current cache, perform an in-place write, and run a full read-back verification; if verification fails, the original file will be rolled back automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击“确认写入”后将自动备份当前缓存、执行原位写入并进行完整读回校验；若校验异常将自动回滚原文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
