          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击继续后将自动打开 PosterBoard，请在后台多任务切换器中将其上滑关闭以完成加载。如果壁纸未显示，请在右上角“壁纸设置”中尝试重置“壁纸合集”、“水星壁纸”或“视频壁纸”。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapping Continue will automatically open PosterBoard; swipe it up in the App Switcher to close it and finish loading. If the wallpaper does not appear, open \"Wallpaper Settings\" in the top-right corner and try resetting \"Collections\", \"Mercury Wallpaper\", or \"Video Wallpapers\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击继续后将自动打开 PosterBoard，请在后台多任务切换器中将其上滑关闭以完成加载。如果壁纸未显示，请在右上角“壁纸设置”中尝试重置“壁纸合集”、“水星壁纸”或“视频壁纸”。"
