    "突破单应用沙盒隔离：支持一键生成或向代理工具共享组写入“国行普通话来电询问 + 海外 Apple 智能”共存分流模块，并通过 APFS clonefile() 零锁快照无损导出 Safari 书签。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breaks single-app sandbox isolation: generate or write a co-existence routing module (\"Mainland Mandarin Call Screening + Apple Intelligence\") directly into proxy tool App Groups with one tap, and losslessly export Safari bookmarks via zero-lock APFS clonefile() snapshots."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "突破单应用沙盒隔离：支持一键生成或向代理工具共享组写入“国行普通话来电询问 + 海外 Apple 智能”共存分流模块，并通过 APFS clonefile() 零锁快照无损导出 Safari 书签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
