    "该备份来自其他机型 (%@)，与本机真实硬件 (%@) 不符，直接写入会导致白苹果软砖！请点击「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」恢复本机原厂配置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This backup belongs to a different device model (%@) and does not match this device's actual hardware (%@). Writing it directly will cause a bootloop soft-brick! Tap \"Rebuild Clean System Factory Cache\" to restore this device's factory configuration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该备份来自其他机型 (%@)，与本机真实硬件 (%@) 不符，直接写入会导致白苹果软砖！请点击「重建系统纯净原厂缓存」恢复本机原厂配置。"
          }
        }
      }
