    "运行时从本机内存中的 libMobileGestalt.dylib 实时解析偏移并严格核对 CacheUUID、长度与有效位；解析失败时严禁修改任何字节。注意：在 iOS 26/27 中，解除 green-tea 或将“无线局域网”改为“Wi-Fi”均会切换为国际版“蜂窝数据”开关逻辑（隐藏单应用“不允许联网”）。应用本组开关后请手动重启手机生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves offsets at runtime from in-memory libMobileGestalt.dylib and strictly verifies CacheUUID, length, and valid bits; never modifies a single byte if resolution fails. Note: On iOS 26/27, disabling green-tea or changing \"WLAN\" (Mainland Wi-Fi label) to \"Wi-Fi\" switches network permissions to the international \"Cellular Data\" toggle behavior (hiding the per-app \"Off\" / block-all-network option). Manually reboot your iPhone after applying these toggles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行时从本机内存中的 libMobileGestalt.dylib 实时解析偏移并严格核对 CacheUUID、长度与有效位；解析失败时严禁修改任何字节。注意：在 iOS 26/27 中，解除 green-tea 或将“无线局域网”改为“Wi-Fi”均会切换为国际版“蜂窝数据”开关逻辑（隐藏单应用“不允许联网”）。应用本组开关后请手动重启手机生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
