    "通过 APFS clonefile() 写时复制将 CurrentPowerlog.PLSQL 瞬时克隆至本应用临时目录后只读解析，零物理写入、绝不阻塞系统 powerlogHelperd 守护进程（注：部分 iOS 26 固件限制了系统级 Powerlog 沙盒令牌下发，iOS 27 真机支持完整读取）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instantly clones CurrentPowerlog.PLSQL into this app's temporary directory via APFS clonefile() copy-on-write for read-only parsing - zero physical writes and never blocks the system powerlogHelperd daemon (Note: some iOS 26 builds restrict system Powerlog sandbox token issuance; iOS 27 devices support full reading)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 APFS clonefile() 写时复制将 CurrentPowerlog.PLSQL 瞬时克隆至本应用临时目录后只读解析，零物理写入、绝不阻塞系统 powerlogHelperd 守护进程（注：部分 iOS 26 固件限制了系统级 Powerlog 沙盒令牌下发，iOS 27 真机支持完整读取）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过 LaunchServices 二进制库毫秒级解析全机应用与共享组，替代慢速 Inode 遍历": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parses all installed apps and App Groups in milliseconds via the binary LaunchServices database, replacing slow inode traversal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 LaunchServices 二进制库毫秒级解析全机应用与共享组，替代慢速 Inode 遍历"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过从本机内存加载的系统库 (libMobileGestalt.dylib) 实时动态解析二进制 CacheData 槽位偏移，将国行底层限制标记 green-tea 设为 false、not-green-tea 设为 true。\n\n• 可在所有国行设备上解锁 FaceTime 音频（语音通话）与 AI 底层区域准入；\n• 在自带物理 eSIM 芯片的国行机型（如 iPhone Air、iPhone 18 系列等内置 eUICC 芯片机型）上，可解除系统层针对境外 eSIM 的地理围栏拦截（注：常规纯双实体卡槽国行主板物理空焊 eUICC 芯片，无法通过纯软件写入虚拟卡）。\n\n⚠️ 注意：在 iOS 26/27 中，国行特有的单应用三态联网菜单（“关闭 / 无线局域网 / 无线局域网与蜂窝数据”）同样受 green-tea 标记控制。即使保持下方“无线局域网改 Wi-Fi”关闭，开启本项解除国行底层限制后，系统网络权限也会切换为国际版“蜂窝数据”独立开关模式（关闭本项并重启即可随时原样恢复）。\n\n安全策略：仅当本机 CacheUUID、总长度、有效位及填充字节 100% 匹配通过时才允许修改；应用后请手动重启手机生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves binary CacheData slot offsets at runtime from the in-memory system library (libMobileGestalt.dylib), setting the Mainland China (CH/A) hardware restriction flag green-tea to false and not-green-tea to true.\n\n• Unlocks FaceTime Audio (voice calls) and low-level AI regional eligibility on all Mainland China (CH/A) devices;\n• On Mainland China (CH/A) models equipped with a physical eSIM chip (such as iPhone Air, iPhone 18 series, and other models with built-in eUICC hardware), lifts OS-level geofencing blocks on overseas eSIM provisioning (Note: standard dual physical nano-SIM Mainland motherboards lack an eUICC chip and cannot install eSIM profiles via software alone).\n\n⚠️ Note: On iOS 26/27, the Mainland-exclusive 3-state per-app network permission menu (\"Off / WLAN / WLAN & Cellular Data\") is also governed by the green-tea flag. Even if \"Change WLAN to Wi-Fi\" below remains off, enabling Unlock Mainland Hardware Flags switches system network permissions to the international standalone \"Cellular Data\" toggle mode (turn this option off and reboot at any time to restore original behavior).\n\nSafety Policy: Modifications are permitted only when this device's CacheUUID, total length, valid bits, and padding bytes match 100%. Manually reboot your iPhone after applying."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过从本机内存加载的系统库 (libMobileGestalt.dylib) 实时动态解析二进制 CacheData 槽位偏移，将国行底层限制标记 green-tea 设为 false、not-green-tea 设为 true。\n\n• 可在所有国行设备上解锁 FaceTime 音频（语音通话）与 AI 底层区域准入；\n• 在自带物理 eSIM 芯片的国行机型（如 iPhone Air、iPhone 18 系列等内置 eUICC 芯片机型）上，可解除系统层针对境外 eSIM 的地理围栏拦截（注：常规纯双实体卡槽国行主板物理空焊 eUICC 芯片，无法通过纯软件写入虚拟卡）。\n\n⚠️ 注意：在 iOS 26/27 中，国行特有的单应用三态联网菜单（“关闭 / 无线局域网 / 无线局域网与蜂窝数据”）同样受 green-tea 标记控制。即使保持下方“无线局域网改 Wi-Fi”关闭，开启本项解除国行底层限制后，系统网络权限也会切换为国际版“蜂窝数据”独立开关模式（关闭本项并重启即可随时原样恢复）。\n\n安全策略：仅当本机 CacheUUID、总长度、有效位及填充字节 100% 匹配通过时才允许修改；应用后请手动重启手机生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 CameracinematicAudioTrackRendering (aVL5GE3tx0LSCI/ErfrJGA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，解锁相册与相机视频编辑中的“混音 (Audio Mix)”功能，支持“标准 / 语音突显 / 录音棚 / 电影效果”四档人声与环境音分离混音（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves the CameracinematicAudioTrackRendering (aVL5GE3tx0LSCI/ErfrJGA) binary CacheData boolean slot from the local system library and sets it to true, unlocking \"Audio Mix\" in Photos and Camera video editing with Standard, In-Frame, Studio, and Cinematic vocal/ambient separation modes (manually reboot your iPhone after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 CameracinematicAudioTrackRendering (aVL5GE3tx0LSCI/ErfrJGA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，解锁相册与相机视频编辑中的“混音 (Audio Mix)”功能，支持“标准 / 语音突显 / 录音棚 / 电影效果”四档人声与环境音分离混音（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 HypertensionNotifications (4fh9efw4o1yaFqkXNCXoeA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，开启“健康”App 中的血压偏高趋势评估、风险通知与测量记录向导页面（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves the HypertensionNotifications (4fh9efw4o1yaFqkXNCXoeA) binary CacheData boolean slot from the local system library and sets it to true, enabling Hypertension Notifications, trend evaluation, and blood pressure logging guides in the Health app (manually reboot your iPhone after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 HypertensionNotifications (4fh9efw4o1yaFqkXNCXoeA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，开启“健康”App 中的血压偏高趋势评估、风险通知与测量记录向导页面（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 ResponsiveShutter (gQDt76Te0SPw7N8oTLrBFw) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，降低相机按下快门至成像管线的触发延迟，实现手指按下瞬间零延迟抓拍（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves the ResponsiveShutter (gQDt76Te0SPw7N8oTLrBFw) binary CacheData boolean slot from the local system library and sets it to true, reducing trigger latency from shutter press to the imaging pipeline for instant zero-lag capture (manually reboot your iPhone after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 ResponsiveShutter (gQDt76Te0SPw7N8oTLrBFw) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，降低相机按下快门至成像管线的触发延迟，实现手指按下瞬间零延迟抓拍（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 spatial-audio-recording (X6NGcYcvHmbqlR8hLXASJA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位，控制相机 3D 空间音频拾音与语音备忘录“录音室 (Studio)”四声道录制模式。\n\n⚠️ 防呆说明：该功能物理依赖 iPhone 16 系列起的四麦克风录音棚声学阵列硬件（支持机型出厂已原生开启）。在三麦克风旧机型（如 iPhone 15 Pro 及更早机型）上强行开启，会导致“语音备忘录”出现无效的“录音室”选项，选择该档位点击录音会因四声道硬件初始化失败立即中断。因此非四麦克风机型已默认防呆锁定关闭（若此前在旧版本开启过，直接关闭本开关并应用重启即可恢复）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves the spatial-audio-recording (X6NGcYcvHmbqlR8hLXASJA) binary CacheData boolean slot from the local system library, controlling Camera 3D Spatial Audio Recording and Voice Memos \"Studio\" 4-channel recording mode.\n\n⚠️ [Safety Guardrail]: This feature physically requires the 4-microphone studio acoustic array introduced on iPhone 16 and later (natively enabled from the factory on supported models). Force-enabling it on older 3-microphone models (such as iPhone 15 Pro and earlier) exposes a non-functional \"Studio\" option in Voice Memos that immediately aborts recording when 4-channel hardware initialization fails. Non-4-mic models are therefore safety-locked off by default (if previously enabled in an older version, simply turn this toggle off, apply, and reboot to restore)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 spatial-audio-recording (X6NGcYcvHmbqlR8hLXASJA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位，控制相机 3D 空间音频拾音与语音备忘录“录音室 (Studio)”四声道录制模式。\n\n⚠️ 防呆说明：该功能物理依赖 iPhone 16 系列起的四麦克风录音棚声学阵列硬件（支持机型出厂已原生开启）。在三麦克风旧机型（如 iPhone 15 Pro 及更早机型）上强行开启，会导致“语音备忘录”出现无效的“录音室”选项，选择该档位点击录音会因四声道硬件初始化失败立即中断。因此非四麦克风机型已默认防呆锁定关闭（若此前在旧版本开启过，直接关闭本开关并应用重启即可恢复）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 spatial-audio-recording 与 spatial-facetime-audio 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并同步设为 true，解锁相机视频录制时的 3D 空间音频拾音及 FaceTime 通话空间声场渲染能力（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves both spatial-audio-recording and spatial-facetime-audio binary CacheData boolean slots from the local system library and sets them to true, unlocking 3D Spatial Audio Recording in Camera videos and Spatial FaceTime Audio rendering during calls (manually reboot your iPhone after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 spatial-audio-recording 与 spatial-facetime-audio 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并同步设为 true，解锁相机视频录制时的 3D 空间音频拾音及 FaceTime 通话空间声场渲染能力（应用后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 spatial-facetime-audio (/EVOCjM/Nmb2roP5ebtEFA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，解锁 FaceTime 通话期间的 3D 空间声场渲染能力（纯软件声学渲染，支持 iPhone 15 Pro 及更早机型，不影响语音备忘录录音，应用后请手动重启手机生效）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves the spatial-facetime-audio (/EVOCjM/Nmb2roP5ebtEFA) binary CacheData boolean slot from the local system library and sets it to true, unlocking 3D Spatial FaceTime Audio soundstage rendering during calls (software-rendered acoustics; supports iPhone 15 Pro and earlier without affecting Voice Memos recording - manually reboot your iPhone after applying)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 spatial-facetime-audio (/EVOCjM/Nmb2roP5ebtEFA) 二进制 CacheData 布尔槽位并设为 true，解锁 FaceTime 通话期间的 3D 空间声场渲染能力（纯软件声学渲染，支持 iPhone 15 Pro 及更早机型，不影响语音备忘录录音，应用后请手动重启手机生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 wapi 布尔槽位偏移并设为 false，将系统“设置”与控制中心里的“无线局域网”统一显示为国际版的“Wi-Fi”。\n\n⚠️ 重要提示：开启后将会【丢失国行特有的“不允许联网”功能】（即“使用无线局域网与蜂窝网络的 App”中的“关闭”选项）！国际版逻辑仅允许单独关闭“蜂窝数据”，无法禁止单个应用使用 Wi-Fi 联网（如第三方输入法或离线应用将无法彻底断网），同时“启用 WAPI”开关也会隐藏。\n\n如需保留应用“不允许联网”权限控制，请保持此项关闭；若已开启，关闭此开关重新应用并手动重启手机即可原样恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamically resolves the wapi boolean slot offset from the local system library and sets it to false, replacing \"WLAN\" (Mainland Wi-Fi label) with international \"Wi-Fi\" across Settings and Control Center.\n\n⚠️ Important Notice: Enabling this will REMOVE the Mainland China (CH/A)-exclusive per-app \"Off\" (block all network access) option under \"Apps Using WLAN & Cellular\"! International iOS behavior only allows disabling \"Cellular Data\" per app and cannot block individual apps from using Wi-Fi (e.g., third-party keyboards or offline apps cannot be completely cut off from the network), and the \"Enable WAPI\" toggle will also be hidden.\n\nKeep this option off if you need per-app complete network blocking; if already enabled, turn this toggle off, re-apply, and manually reboot your iPhone to restore original behavior."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过本机系统库实时动态解析 wapi 布尔槽位偏移并设为 false，将系统“设置”与控制中心里的“无线局域网”统一显示为国际版的“Wi-Fi”。\n\n⚠️ 重要提示：开启后将会【丢失国行特有的“不允许联网”功能】（即“使用无线局域网与蜂窝网络的 App”中的“关闭”选项）！国际版逻辑仅允许单独关闭“蜂窝数据”，无法禁止单个应用使用 Wi-Fi 联网（如第三方输入法或离线应用将无法彻底断网），同时“启用 WAPI”开关也会隐藏。\n\n如需保留应用“不允许联网”权限控制，请保持此项关闭；若已开启，关闭此开关重新应用并手动重启手机即可原样恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
