    "重置 MobileGestalt 将删除系统原始缓存文件并让系统在重启时重新生成。这有助于彻底清除无法还原的修改，但存在极低概率引发异常，请谨慎操作。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resetting MobileGestalt deletes the raw system cache file so iOS regenerates a fresh copy on reboot. This helps thoroughly clear tweaks that cannot be reverted normally, though it carries a very small risk of unexpected issues - proceed with caution."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置 MobileGestalt 将删除系统原始缓存文件并让系统在重启时重新生成。这有助于彻底清除无法还原的修改，但存在极低概率引发异常，请谨慎操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
