    "防白苹果安全协议已永久锁定无零字节窗口原位覆盖（pwrite + F_FULLFSYNC）与系统级安全金库双备份冗余，即使侧载掉签卸载重装应用也不会丢失原厂初始备份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bootloop safety protocol permanently enforces zero-byte-window-free in-place writes (pwrite + F_FULLFSYNC) and dual-redundant system vault backups, preserving your initial Factory Backup even if the sideloaded app expires, is uninstalled, and is reinstalled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防白苹果安全协议已永久锁定无零字节窗口原位覆盖（pwrite + F_FULLFSYNC）与系统级安全金库双备份冗余，即使侧载掉签卸载重装应用也不会丢失原厂初始备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "降低相机按下快门至成像管线的触发延迟，实现零延迟抓拍": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reduces trigger latency from shutter press to the imaging pipeline for zero-lag capture"
